(7760771, 1285362, 98565, '<td valign="top">lovely insight, well seen and captured.<br/> <br/>Fun fact:<br/>This seems to be an Italian restaurant - but "Tedesco" means "German" in the Italian language<br/>Tedescos is the amercanized plural, since the plural of Tedesco in Italian is "Tedeschi"</td>', 'lovely insight, well seen and captured. Fun fact:This seems to be an Italian restaurant - but "Tedesco" means "German" in the Italian languageTedescos is the amercanized plural, since the plural of Tedesco in Italian is "Tedeschi"', '2023-12-07 03:10:33.000000', NULL, 0);
